   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# TypeII Symbols Unit Tests\n\nCoverage:\n- TypeII superghost field registration\n- GSO parity for superghost and linear-dilaton fields\n- Scalar GSOParity consistency with holo/antiholo helpers",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Needs[\"StringCode`\"]\nStringCode`InitStringCode[<|\"theory\" -> \"TypeII\", \"CFT\" -> \"FlatSpace\", \"conventions\" -> \"TypeII-Xi\", \"bracket\" -> \"Flat\"|>]",
